  "content": "\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n\n<p><img alt=\"3d-carved-pumpkins\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BZbFQNv.png\"></p>\n\n<h1>Undopia 3D 雕刻南瓜</h1>\n\n<p>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fundopia-3d-carved-pumpkins\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"Modrinth 下載次數\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/undopia-3d-carved-pumpkins?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth&label=Modrinth&color=1bd96a\">\n    </a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/undopia-3d-carved-pumpkins\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"CurseForge 下載次數\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1200245?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge&label=CurseForge&color=f16436\">\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<p>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fundugt\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n        <img alt=\"ko-fi\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/wv1uE4k.png\">\n    </a>\n</p>\n\n<p>3D 雕刻南瓜為雕刻南瓜與南瓜燈增添了輕微的 3D 深度。\n此外，它為所有南瓜添加了自訂的底面紋理。</p>\n\n<hr>\n\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpatch.undopia.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Undopia Patch 資源包\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/beZ50qS.png\"></a></p>\n\n<p>本資源包屬於 Undopia Patch 系列。</p>\n\n<p>它包含以下 Undopia Patch 功能：</p>\n\n<p>\n    <img alt=\"LVNUauL.png\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LVNUauL.png\">\n<img alt=\"Ttelamu.png\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ttelamu.png\">\n\n</p>\n\n<p>如果您想自訂其中任何一項，請使用 Undopia Patch 自訂工具。</p>\n\n</div>\n<div style=\"text-align:center\">\n\n<hr>\n\n<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fkcbhosting.com%252faff%252fundopia\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n\n<img alt=\"Wb9cSra.png\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Wb9cSra.png\">\n\n<p>從 <strong>KCB Hosting</strong> 取得您專屬的自訂遊戲伺服器！</p>\n\n</a>\n\n<hr>\n\n\n<p>\n    <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpatch.undopia.net%252fcustom-downloads%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"自訂工具\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/UEAZSvr.pn